  "bio": "Drevis, based in Chicago, United States, is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in fineline, illustrative, and floral styles. Their intricate designs and precise line work set them apart as a master of their craft, making Drevis a sought-after artist for anyone seeking exceptional tattoos with an anime touch. Remember to complete the booking form to secure a spot with this proficient artisan.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Chicago, Illinois, United States\n\nCONS: VILLAIN ARTS, ACEN, ANIME MAGIC INK'D\nbraaiinnnnsss…\n@5thcloudstudios \nBooks are open! 📖",
